@GithubDownloader_Web_HostAddress = http://localhost:5033

### Health
GET {{GithubDownloader_Web_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### List repositories
GET {{GithubDownloader_Web_HostAddress}}/api/repositories
Accept: application/json

### Add repository by URL
POST {{GithubDownloader_Web_HostAddress}}/api/repositories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "repoUrl": "https://github.com/owner/repo"
}

### Add repository by name
POST {{GithubDownloader_Web_HostAddress}}/api/repositories/by-name
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "publisherName": "owner",
  "repoName": "repo"
}

### Search for updates
POST {{GithubDownloader_Web_HostAddress}}/api/updates/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "repoUrls": null
}

### Settings info
GET {{GithubDownloader_Web_HostAddress}}/api/settings/info
Accept: application/json